  "body": "Our motivated vendors have found their next move, and this beautiful home must be sold!\r\n\r\nWhy wait to build when you can move straight into something this beautiful?\r\n\r\nJust 18 months young and still looking sparkling new, this home offers modern style, everyday comfort and easy coastal living. Beautifully presented and thoughtfully designed, this is a home where all the hard work has been done.\r\n\r\nStep inside and immediately appreciate the light, space and fresh contemporary feel. At the heart of the home is a stunning open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, where sleek cabinetry, warm timber tones and natural light create a welcoming space for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors connect the living spaces with the outdoors, opening to the deck and garden. Perfect for summer barbecues, relaxing in the sunshine or enjoying time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThe elevated deck is another highlight, overlooking the surrounding greenery and neighbourhood. A wonderful spot to unwind with a drink and enjoy the beautiful colours of the evening sky.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom offers a peaceful retreat, complete with an ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and direct deck access. Two further bedrooms provide space for family, guests or a home office, while the stylish family bathroom features cpompletes the home.\r\n\r\nWith single-level living, internal-access garaging and an easy-care section, this home is ideal for families, professionals, downsizers or anyone wanting the benefits of a nearly new home without the hassle of building.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location!\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour is one of the Hibiscus Coast's wonderful coastal communities, where weekends can be spent exploring beautiful beaches, enjoying waterfront cafes and restaurants at Gulf Harbour Marina, or discovering the spectacular scenery and walking tracks of nearby Shakespeare Regional Park.\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour School and Wentworth Primary and College are nearby, while the Gulf Harbour ferry offers a scenic commuting option to Auckland City.\r\n\r\nFrom morning walks along the coast to sunset drinks on your own deck, this is a lifestyle that's easy to fall in love with.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are committed to their next move, so don't miss this opportunity!\r\n\r\nCome along to our next open home or contact us to arrange your private viewing.",
